	(title_block (title "MeshSat Field Kit carrier - PCB-E1 DOCK") (date "2026-09-16") (rev "A (E6)") (company "MeshSat") (comment 1 "Phase E11 schematic (MESHSAT-830, appendix 32.55 to 32.57), generated by tools/gen_sch_e.py. Netlist style: every pin carries a stub and a net label.") (comment 2 "E6: BB-2590/U cable entry and 25 A blade to the raised block; vehicle input 9-36 V through LM74700, LM5069 hot-swap and the SRF1260 filter to the raw bus up the dock contacts; LT8705A panel tracker ORed into the bus; RP2040 sensor controller on USB (BME688, BMI270, water electrodes, fans, pack SMBus, Geiger, DCF77, lightning and pod headers); eleven float clamps."))
